{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_015_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:75b06b6f6a4796173c92a3e299d931d6f068cb3573a88b5868ee156a71c58923",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_23:5_01_015_23_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42eba84c7900c6aa926bc7c2ee2af88b2448c534166b8e7e514f578fa34a1a87",
      "text": "啊，制作人。辛苦了。\n正好遇到你真是太巧了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_23:5_01_015_23_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec1ad74b3b49379f16f4096f56d6066ee3a39bc7515c70e8672c25b895ba8ad3",
      "text": "我是想为你昨天送我的巧克力道谢呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_23:5_01_015_23_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:759500a84c837f71ac82bc7475f1da9dbf196da57aa5547afd8d5ac7bbd7db24",
      "text": "在那之后，在回家的路上我把巧克力给弄掉了。\n而且，到了家附近还突然下起了倾盆大雨。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_23:5_01_015_23_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a6aad0a0a6e066328f669867a27e83439725733dee957c424f1c459ec1c0b02",
      "text": "不过，正好有开车的家人碰巧在附近呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_23:5_01_015_23_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fb5dc909302d7b1e8fc4104d92c6885ed2739c2647f088825700182d3255c16",
      "text": "不仅没怎么被淋湿，\n不小心弄掉的巧克力也完好无损哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_23:5_01_015_23_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01ffa7552b11f7cfa7c1ca71658c5d53f937a6f196b5e81a32b7e9c7c11e882f",
      "text": "说不定，正因为有那盒巧克力在，\n才能逢凶化吉化险为夷？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_23:5_01_015_23_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7d1be54caedca6c51158468511397e981b89870f4a98461b937034088870091",
      "text": "这么一想，●●●●プロデューサー，\n简直就像是幸运之神一样呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_23:5_01_015_23_a:cmd-000060:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4afafde2efbb81e66524505bba4dab63c5c2fdf115506e2f08d8fb0276cdf38",
      "text": "龙先生和巧克力都平安无事真是太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_23:5_01_015_23_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:673c90c138ceece33305d896902957967c9b4ebbf2cfc8b7a1ef259e485a1dcc",
      "text": "是啊，多亏了制作人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_015_23:5_01_015_23_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1e5c1296cec364d5d67a76539c9794c1539d163a918f618fd7c11a969a73826",
      "text": "借着这股势头，今天的工作我也要顺顺利利地搞定！\n那我出发啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
